"""Traveller question bank for country pages. Reusable across countries.

Each question has a stable ID, a category, a template with {country}, the traveller
it serves, the decision dimension it informs and the page level where the full
answer belongs. Country scoring lives separately (see france/score.py).

Run: python3 audit/question_bank.py   -> writes audit/question_bank.json
"""
